# Secrets. None of these belong in the repository.
#
# Matched by pattern rather than by exact path, because naming one file was not
# enough: Firebase names a service account key after the project plus a random
# suffix, and it lands wherever the browser saved it. One such key sat untracked
# in web/ and was a single `git add web/` away from being public.
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*-private.pem
**/*-public.pem
agent/config.json

node_modules/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
*.log
.firebase/
